WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Are you playing Sun Tzu's Art of War with me?

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,600
You are all liars in this business.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,600
He also said that my daughter is a child

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,400
You are blind and can’t tell whether she is a boy or a girl.

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,000
Yuling, I'm here to help.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,840
Marry you

7
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:17,040
My daughter named Qiao was weak when she was a child, so why don't you look for Wu Yi?

8
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,240
Which time did it work?

9
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:21,040
You let me accompany you to the hospital to live to this age.

10
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:23,320
Don't believe it either

11
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:27,580
Shen Zi, I can take nothing from you

12
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,180
Can you let me help your daughter paint her sister's house?

13
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,980
Not learning well at a young age

14
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:38,370
I don’t know how your parents taught her to scold me.

15
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,730
But she was scolding her own daughter for her life

16
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,730
Not even if you don't take any money.

17
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:45,530
No one cares about this girl’s life? Xiaotie?

18
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:48,980
Do you know why people charge money to cheat? I don’t know.

19
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:49,980
because of cause and effect

20
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:50,980
Show this person

21
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,380
Just get involved in her cause and effect

22
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:53,780
Taking on the cause and effect that belongs to her

23
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:56,640
So she needs to give you money to settle this cause and effect.

24
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,240
The greater the cause and effect, the more money you will receive.

25
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:00,740
This is called breaking the rules and avoiding disasters

26
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:05,310
Will that girl really die?

27
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:07,810
It turns out that even if you have the ability, you cannot solve all problems.
